                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.102 Ic/15: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Ruddock</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-08-12T14:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 12,
                                1921—2 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>226. Your 283, August 9, 5 p.m.</p>
                <p>Denial of asylum should be left to diplomatic body and nationality concerned.
                    Report details of any case/actually arising.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
